cards.desc:
If this card battles a monster, neither can be destroyed by that battle. You can discard this card, then activate 1 of these effects (but you can only use each effect of "Dark-Eyes Illusionist Faceless Mage" once per turn);
● Place 1 "Mind Scan" from your hand or Deck, face-up on your field.
● Add 1 other monster that mentions "Toon World" from your GY to your hand, then you can Special Summon it, ignoring its Summoning conditions.
